  (7367, 'crystals', 'Clusters & Display', 'Brazil Quartz Crystal Cluster on Stand', 12.9, 'Clear Quartz', 'clarity', 'p7367.jpg', 'Length of the Stone: 6.80cm · Width f the Stone: 3.26cm · Depth of the Stone: 3.62cm · Length with the Stand: 9.30cm · This is a One Of A Kind Item. · You will receive this exact item as pictured!', false, true),
