  (4694, 'crystals', 'Gift Sets', 'Crystal Advent Calendar – 2nd Edition (2023 Edition)', 65.0, 'Mixed', 'clarity', 'p4694.jpg', '24 Different Gemstones from all over the World Raw and Polished Each Gemstone is packed with an info card in a Christmas decorated Box.', false, true),
