  (6058, 'crystals', 'Tree of Life', 'Smokey Quartz Tree Of Life 1000 Chips', 85.0, 'Smoky Quartz', 'grounding', 'p6058.jpg', 'Tree of Life with Smoky Quartz Chips Enhance your space with this stunning Tree of Life handcrafted with Smoky Quartz chips, known for their grounding and protective energy. Set on a sturdy base, this elegant crystal tree symbolizes strength, growth, and balance. Smoky Quartz is believed to absorb negativity and promote clarity, making it a perfect addition to your home, office', false, false),
