  (4865, 'jewellery', 'Earrings', 'Gold Plated on Sterling Silver 925 Citrine Earrings', 43.5, 'Citrine', 'abundance', 'p4865.jpg', 'Citrine is a cheerful and highly energising stone. It radiates the suns energy and fills the wearer with positivity and confidence. Citrine helps you perceive life through the lens of love. It is also said to be a stone of prosperity.', false, false),
