  (2424, 'jewellery', 'Necklaces', 'Otodus Shark Fossil Tooth Necklace 2cms', 8.9, 'Fossil', 'grounding', 'p2424.jpg', 'Otodus sharks used to live from the Paleocene to the Eocene period around 50 million years ago. These sharks would have been one and a half times bigger than a great white shark. This means that they grew up to around 9 metres!', false, false),
  (1912, 'jewellery', 'Earrings', 'AAA Quality 925 Sterling Turquoise Earrings', 39.0, 'Turquoise', 'love', 'p1912.jpg', 'Turquoise is a symbol of friendship and a stimulator of romantic love. It’s a great stone for stabilising mood swings and promotes inner calmness. Turquoise aids healing depression and exhaustion. It also aids people prevent panic attacks.', false, false),
  (5946, 'metaphysical', 'Singing Bowls', '9cm Nepalese Singing Bowl', 29.0, 'Brass', 'calm', 'p5946.jpg', 'Discover the soothing sounds of our authentic Nepalese Singing Bowls, handcrafted by skilled artisans using traditional techniques. Made from high-quality 7 metals, these bowls produce rich, resonant tones that promote relaxation, meditation, and healing. Perfect for mindfulness practices, yoga sessions, or home décor, each bowl is a unique piece of art designed to bring harmon', false, false),
  (3077, 'metaphysical', 'Singing Bowls', 'Singing Bowl, Origin: Nepal, 15cm', 85.0, 'Brass', 'calm', 'p3077.jpg', 'The benefits of Nepalese Singing Bowl meditation include physical, emotional, and spiritual benefits. It can help to reduce stress and anxiety, improve sleep, boost the immune system, and increase overall wellbeing.', true, false),
  (2754, 'metaphysical', 'Wind Chimes', 'Tree of Life Chakra Agate Wind Chime Large', 45.0, 'Agate', 'abundance', 'p2754.jpg', 'Agate is a stone of mental enhancement. It’s a stone of comfort and is quite beneficial in strengthening the person. It gives you the power to fight any problems you might be dealing with, be it depression or anxiety.', false, false),
  (1268, 'metaphysical', 'Pendulums', 'Rose Quartz Pendulum', 9.9, 'Rose Quartz', 'love', 'p1268.jpg', 'Crystal pendulums and dowsing pendulums are popular tools used for divination and can help you tune into your intuitive powers. Crystal pendulums are popular for dowsing and are available made from a variety of different stones – many of which carry their own unique properties too. All dowsing pendulums perform the same function regardless of what they’re made of. Simply choose', false, false),
  (1581, 'metaphysical', 'Pyramids', 'Medium Shungite Pyramid', 18.5, 'Shungite', 'protection', 'p1581.jpg', 'Healing pyramid of shungite removed geopathogenic and technogenic effects, improve your mental and physical condition.', false, false),
