  (4632, 'metaphysical', 'Smudging & Incense', 'Palo Santo Smudging sticks', 1.9, 'Palo Santo', 'protection', 'p4632.jpg', 'Often used in smudging and cleansing rituals, Palo Santo is known to bring healing and good fortune when burned, transmitting negativity to positivity. Used in much the same way as sage, Palo Santo is a perfect companion for those who partake in meditation, yoga, reiki and other mindful and spiritual practices.', false, false),
