  (5031, 'home', 'Bookends', 'Petrified Wood Bookends – Origin Indonesia', 85.0, 'Petrified Wood', 'grounding', 'p5031.jpg', 'Elevate your home library or office with these stunning petrified wood bookends, each piece a natural work of art formed over millions of years. These bookends are not only functional but also serve as captivating geological specimens, showcasing the timeless beauty of fossilization. The deep, layered hues of the petrified wood tell a story that spans geological epochs, with ea', false, false),
