  (6701, 'home', 'Limestone Carvings', 'Mary and Baby Jesus carved in Limestone', 69.0, 'Maltese Limestone', 'grounding', 'p6701.jpg', 'A serene depiction of Mary cradling Baby Jesus, hand-carved in natural Maltese limestone. This timeless piece captures the sacred bond of mother and child, blending faith and craftsmanship in stone. · • Material: Genuine Maltese Limestone · •Length by Width: 22,9cm by 20,1cm · • Finish: Natural stone – sealed for protection · • Crafted in Malta with pride and precision · • Read', false, true),
